// SuperCollider: two saws a hertz apart through a resonant lowpass that an lfo sweeps
//
//   { RLPF.ar(Saw.ar([100, 101], 0.1), SinOsc.kr(0.2).range(300, 3000), 0.2) }.play
//
// SuperCollider's Saw is half the size of what its mul says (it swings between -0.5 and 0.5, measured with
// SuperCollider 3.14.1, and it falls where harp's saw rises), so the mul of 0.1 is 0.05 here
//
// RLPF takes rq, the reciprocal of Q (0.2 is a Q of 5); the filter of psalm takes res from 0 to 1,
// where res = 1 - rq/2 (0.9 is a Q of 5 too)

out = saw([100, 101]).gain(0.05)
  .lowpass(cutoff: lfo(0.2).range(300, 3000), res: 0.9)
